OL,3,ASpitting Image co-creator Peter Fluck
OL,4,Adies aged 85
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The spirit that Spitting Image brought
OL,7,Fto the country was epoch defining," a
OL,8,Ffamily statement said.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/38
